   "section": "risk",
   "note": "Evidence for the AI-delay and new-category risks: the next Apple Foundation Models will be based on Google Gemini under a multi-year deal announced 2026-01-12 (reported ~$1bn/yr), and Vision Pro shipped ~45,000 units in Q4 2025 after the M5 refresh, ~600,000 lifetime, with IDC forecasting ~290,000 units in 2026. Both are usable base rates for execution risk.",
