   "section": "technology_product",
   "note": "Two product-gating facts for the technology section: China's CAC registered Apple Intelligence on 2026-07-15 with Alibaba Qwen and Baidu after a ~22-month gap; and Apple's Q3 FY2026 10-Q warns DMA interoperability obligations have in the past, and may in future, caused it not to launch or maintain features \"such as Siri AI\" in certain jurisdictions. Availability is now a regulatory variable, not only an engineering one.",
