   "section": "risk",
   "note": "For the risk section: the China loss thesis needs a 2026 datapoint. Greater China revenue rose 30% to $64,839m in the nine months to 2026-06-27 (from $49,884m) and Apple's China unit share rose 4.2 points to 18.1% in Q2 2026, while Huawei holds 22.6% and grew 19.9%. The live risk is not share loss but volume: IDC expects China shipments down about 20% in H2 2026, with recovery only around 2028-29. Sources S6, S40, S66.",
